  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.zkSyncOASIS v2.0.5\n\nConnects the OASIS to zkSync Era — a ZK rollup EVM L2 with native account abstraction (chain ID 324). Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and NFTs on zkSync Mainnet. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture.\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.4\n- Add verified zkSync and Abstract native CQL walkthroughs (a32a24e)\n- Fix zkSync CQL authority and chain identity; document native runtime gate (3d693e1)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.ZkSyncOASIS",
